    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20892" root="سنج" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُنْجَةٌ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُقْطَةٌ</span> [i. e. <i>Blackness mixed with
speckles of white:</i> or <i>the reverse:</i> or <i>speckles of
white,</i> and <i>of black,</i> and <i>of red,</i> and <i>of yellow,</i> in
an animal]: (AA, O, K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُنَجٌ</span>, (O, K, TA,
in the CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُنْجٌ</span>,) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُجَرٌ</span> (K, TA, in the CK
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُجْرٌ</span>,) as pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُجْرَةٌ</span>. (TA.)

